            "⌨  Master Width -5% / +5%:  Mod + h  /  Mod + l\n"
            "⌨  Swap Focused w/ Master:  Mod + Enter\n"
            "⌨  Master Count +1 / -1:    Mod + i  /  Mod + d\n"
            "🖱  Mouse Resize (Float):    Hold Mod + Right-Click drag",
